  RoleSummaries:
  - tough, fights up close
  - fires fast from a distance
  - lobs zones that hold ground
  ShapeSummaries:
  - a laser from the eyes that pierces every enemy on its line
  - a fan of light from the eyes, right in front of you
  - a lobbed shot that leaves a damaging zone for 3 s
  - a stare that rolls forward as a wide front, even over walls
  - a burst of looks all around you
  EffectSummaries:
  - full damage, nothing else
  - less damage at once, then burns for 3 s
  - slows the target for 2.5 s
  - roots the target for 1.2 s
  - heals you for each enemy hit
  - drains the target's attack energy
  - your attacks hit 35% harder for 4 s
  - refills your attack energy
  - removes half of the target's special charge
  - a weak hit, then poison for 5 s
  DeliverySummaries:
  - one hit at full strength
  - fires twice, half a second apart, 60% each
  - goes out at 60%, then comes back to you at 80%
  - hits at 50%, then leaves a zone for 3 s
  - 'a super attack: one strike 1.6 times as wide, at 125%'
